# Caddy on minifw — rewrite host.docker.internal → LAN IPs after Mac strip.
# Replace MINI_LAN_IP and PI_LAN_IP before deploy.
# Services already on minifw use 127.0.0.1 via host-gateway OR the published port on 192.168.68.64.

